{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggeHGdb2nakM8kUnFMen","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Model.** For tetrahedral d⁸ the ground state is ³T₁(F). I use the Tanabe–Sugano matrix in the strong-field Td form, with D = Dq (positive) and the F–P configuration interaction on the ³T₁ states.\n\nEnergies before mixing:\n- ³T₁(F) = −6D\n- ³T₂ = +2D\n- ³A₂ = +12D\n- ³T₁(P) = 15B + 6D\n\nThe two ³T₁ states mix through the matrix [[−6D, 6B], [6B, 15B + 6D]]. Call its lower root E_g. This root is the ground state, which is pushed down by the mixing.\n\nThe three transitions are then:\n- ν₁ (³T₂) = 2D − E_g\n- ν₂ (³A₂) = 12D − E_g\n- ν₃ (³T₁(P)) = 15B − 2E_g\n\n**Fit.** I solved with ν₂ = 7 870 cm⁻¹ and ν₃ = 16 410 cm⁻¹, because both of these bands depend on the ground-state shift in a well-defined way.\n\nFrom ν₂ and ν₃:\n- E_g = 12D − 7 870\n- 15B = 670 + 24D\n\nSubstituting into the ³T₁ secular equation gives (7 870 − 18D)(8 540 + 18D) = 36B². This is solved by D ≈ 382 cm⁻¹, which gives B ≈ 655 cm⁻¹.\n\n**Consistency check.** With these values the predicted ν₁ is about 4 060 cm⁻¹, against 3 600 cm⁻¹ observed. That is a misfit of roughly 450 cm⁻¹.\n\nI also tried using ν₁ and ν₂ together. That gave D ≈ 427 cm⁻¹ but B ≈ 207 cm⁻¹, which is unphysically small, and it does not reproduce ν₃. So the three bands cannot all be fitted exactly with a two-parameter (D, B) model.\n\nThe most likely cause is that ν₁ lies in the near-IR and is broad and hard to locate. Spin–orbit coupling and low-symmetry distortion also affect this band.\n\n**Result:**\n- Dq ≈ 380 cm⁻¹ (10Dq ≈ 3 800 cm⁻¹)\n- B ≈ 655 cm⁻¹, about 63% of the free-ion value of ~1 040 cm⁻¹\n\nC is not determined, because only spin-allowed triplet bands were given.\n\n{\"Dq\": 382, \"B\": 655, \"C\": null, \"out_of_scope\": false, \"reason\": \"Fit of nu2 and nu3 with F-P mixing in the Td d8 model gives Dq≈382 and B≈655 cm^-1; nu1 is reproduced only approximately (~4060 vs 3600 cm^-1).\"}"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":796,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":796,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d831194a-3a6d-4060-9d68-cba8f29462a3","uuid":"076f8938-c76b-41cd-9222-b4257a157628","timestamp":"2026-11-03T20:42:40.491Z","request_id":"req_011CggeHGHkZx6Pzu2ETJTpG"}
